# THE PLATFORM REFUSED TO SAY. Background App Refresh is off, or the permission
# was never granted — and "Background App Refresh is off" is a sentence a member
# reads, because registration is observable rather than assumed
# (`docs/mobile-offline.md:214`). NOT the same value as OFFLINE.
availability: AVAILABILITY_READY
durability: DURABILITY_LOCAL_ONLY
pending { queued_writes: 2 queued_uploads: 41 oldest_queued_seconds: 7200 }
connectivity: CONNECTIVITY_UNKNOWN_PLATFORM_REFUSED
